<title>GERMANY: Allianz Leben details 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>Allianz Leben details 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group sums insured		    290,200    vs 276,400</p>
<p>    Group premium income		   12,000    vs  11,500</p>
<p>    Net profit				    190    vs     158</p>
<p>    Capital investments (volume)	118,300    vs 109,600</p>
<p>    Return from capital investments     8,900    vs   8,300</p>
<p>    Dividend (already reported)	    11	vs 11 dmk</p>
<p>    Plus anniversary bonus		 1.50 dmk  vs n/a</p>
<p>    Staff					4,666     vs 4,722</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Allianz Lebensversicherungs-AG, the life insurance arm of Allianz AG Holding. The company had already reported its net profit, premium income and dividend. The bonus payout is for the company's 75th anniversary.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
